# Vercel uploads the working directory, NOT the git index — it reads this file,
# not .gitignore. Without these rules `vercel deploy` tries to upload the 27GB
# of camera masters in public/media/ and fails outright on Vercel's 2GB
# per-file limit (one master is 5.78GB).
#
# Production deploys normally come from the connected GitHub repo, which only
# ever contains the committed derivatives, so this matters for manual CLI
# deploys.
#
# Keep in sync with the matching block in .gitignore.
public/media/*
!public/media/placeholder
